.TH "bioterrorism-by-belowabsolutezero" "6" "2026-11-12" "Bioterrorism User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
bioterrorism-by-belowabsolutezero - Bioterrorism, a 1k intro by Below
Absolute Zero
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
bioterrorism-by-belowabsolutezero
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Bioterrorism is a 1k intro released by Below Absolute Zero in August
2013.
It ranked 7th in the PC 1k competition at Assembly 2013.
.PP
The executable is a small shell header followed by the gzip-compressed
intro.
It is unpacked in a private temporary file, run, then removed.
.PP
This package builds the \[lq]clean\[rq] version provided by the authors:
the intro runs in an 800x600 window and stops at the end of the music,
or when a key is pressed.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
This program has no options.
